","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%96%87%E5%B7%9D%E5%B8%82"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94457194"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q494606"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159129631","name":"开城特级","country":"PRK","lat":37.964,"lon":126.56441,"kind":"city","region":"KP-06","rank":8,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"开城特级 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"市区被松岳山（海拔489米）、蜈蚣山 (오공산/지네산) 等山脉环抱。\n位于朝鲜半岛的中西部的低地，被京畿道、黄海北道、黄海南道及江原道包围。","culture":"亦为高丽时代的古都，经历了五百多年的繁荣，传统商业兴盛。\n2003年6月，开始建设第1期区划，2005年已经出产一些产品，韩国人员越三八线往来开城。","see":"观音寺的遗迹：位于「大兴山城」的北门内约一公里处，建于公元970年，现存建筑有「大雄殿」、「僧房」、高丽时代的「七层石塔」、「观音窟」。\n高丽博物馆荟萃高丽时代的珍贵文物，还有满月台、开城南大门、成均馆，市郊有历代王宫王陵遗迹及古迹等70多处、及北部24公里的朴渊瀑布天然景物。","scope":"reference","qid":"Q109079","articleTitle":"開城市","sourceRevision":93719000,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 开城市","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%96%8B%E5%9F%8E%E5%B8%82"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93719000"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q109079"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159129639","name":"长山","country":"PRK","lat":40.82548,"lon":125.80084,"kind":"city","region":"KP-04","rank":8,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159129645","name":"满浦","country":"PRK","lat":41.14543,"lon":126.29585,"kind":"city","region":"KP-04","rank":8,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"满浦 · 地点概要","geo":"满浦市是朝鲜民主主义人民共和国慈江道北部的一个城市，满浦线经过，位于鸭绿江以南，与中华人民共和国吉林省集安市相望。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q698064","articleTitle":"滿浦市","sourceRevision":90948154,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 满浦市","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%BB%BF%E6%B5%A6%E5%B8%82"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90948154"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q698064"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159129653","name":"顺川","country":"PRK","lat":39.4236,"lon":125.93897,"kind":"city","region":"KP-02","rank":8,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"顺川 · 地点概要","geo":"顺川市是朝鲜民主主义人民共和国平安南道中部的一个城市，东西为山地，大同江流经形成顺川盆地。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q715946","articleTitle":"順川市","sourceRevision":84128039,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 顺川市","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%A0%86%E5%B7%9D%E5%B8%82"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=84128039"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q715946"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159129659","name":"金亨权","country":"PRK","lat":40.81752,"lon":128.15532,"kind":"city","region":"KP-10","rank":8,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159116707","name":"沙里院","country":"PRK","lat":38.507,"lon":125.76201,"kind":"city","region":"KP-06","rank":10,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"沙里院 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"处于载宁平原的西部，铁路京义线上的交通要冲。","culture":"朝鲜王朝时，沙里院曾归黄海道凤山郡，自公元1910年成为凤山郡的郡会，在公元1947年6月升格为市。","see":"正方山游览地：位于沙里院以北约8公里，最高峰处是481公呎，是韩国国花无穷花的原产地、正方山瀑布、悬崖峭壁、榉树丛林繁茂。\n约在公元1632年-1635年修筑的城堡，其中城南门是四道城门中最高及瑰丽。\n邻近有「景岩饭店」、「历史博物馆」等大型建筑以及民俗小吃店等建筑群。","scope":"reference","qid":"Q505807","articleTitle":"沙里院市","sourceRevision":88876413,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 沙里院市","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B2%99%E9%87%8C%E9%99%A2%E5%B8%82"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88876413"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q505807"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159116729","name":"新泥","country":"PRK","lat":39.488,"lon":125.464,"kind":"city","region":"KP-02","rank":10,"capital":0}]}